  /* The "no thumbnail" placeholder is a white raster painted as a background-image, so the dark well never shows. Inverted, keyed on this one URL so real artwork on the same class is untouched. It also ships as a real <img> with the white baked into the raster, which no background rule can reach; keying on the filename in `src` can never match artwork, whose URLs are content hashes, and <img> has no children so the filter cannot leak onto sibling badges. */
  .NC-Thumbnail-image[style*="no_thumbnail"],
