  /* video_top (the legacy video home). A page family the modern-home rules never reach: the only page still mounting the legacy site header, the "video introduction" player and the お知らせ lists, and where the *Container neutralisers above are alive and blank surfaces it needs. Everything below sits after the broad text/meta passes on purpose — most of it undoes one and ties with it on specificity. */
